WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:05,250
I walked in a hurry last time.

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:06,250
I didn’t give you any money either.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,250
Aunt Yang, if you have anything to say, just say it.

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:10,250
There's no need to be so polite between us.

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,250
I moved to Beiyun Village

6
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:14,250
A church was also established last month

7
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,250
It’s not okay to lie down after standing up

8
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,250
The hospital can't find anything wrong

9
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:18,250
This should be because the entrance to the hall was not set up properly.

10
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:19,250
That's an empty hall

11
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,250
There is not a single box on the menu.

12
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,250
There are only a few lonely ghosts squatting there

13
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,280
A day longer is a waste of time

14
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,280
Who set it up for her

15
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,280
A woman who sees things in Lincun

16
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,280
Received 8,800 Xiaoting

17
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,280
Can you go and have a look?

18
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:34,570
But early tomorrow morning

19
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:40,820
It's my birthday next month, Xiaoting

20
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:44,390
Happy birthday to you in advance

21
00:00:44,390 --> 00:00:47,650
Are you too early?

22
00:00:47,650 --> 00:00:51,900
Why does Xiao Cui feel weird?
